      "paperId": "ac978bf8aec9a8c3565a1a03bf6ef3d731c94102",
      "title": "Bude z\u00edt\u0159ek posthumanitn\u00ed?",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Zden\u011bk M\u00fcller",
